    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a> that is aware of type mappings and potential\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/spel/spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.spel.spi\"><code>extensions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core 中的接口\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a>，该创建器能够感知类型映射以及潜在的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/spel/spi/EvaluationContextExtension.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.spel.spi 中的类或接口\"><code>extensions</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a> that is aware of conversions applied by the given\n<a href=\"convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core 中的接口\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a>，该创建器能够感知由给定的\n<a href=\"convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a> 所应用的转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the <a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>创建<a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema 中的接口\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A filter <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> that matches <a href=\"mapping/Encrypted.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>encrypted properties</code></a> and those having nested ones.",
      "translation": "一个过滤器<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>Predicate</code></a>，用于匹配<a href=\"mapping/Encrypted.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>加密属性</code></a>以及具有嵌套属性的那些。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a merged <a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a> out of the individual schemas of the given types by merging their\nproperties into one large <a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定类型的各个模式，将其属性合并到一个大的<a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema 中的接口\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a>中，从而创建一个合并的<a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema 中的接口\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
