    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a> that does not consider potential extensions - suitable for testing. We\nrecommend to use <a href=\"#create(org.springframework.data.mapping.context.MappingContext)\"><code>create(MappingContext)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个不考虑潜在扩展的新的<a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core 中的接口\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a>——适用于测试。我们建议使用<a href=\"#create(org.springframework.data.mapping.context.MappingContext)\"><code>create(MappingContext)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The context in which a specific <a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.JsonSchemaPropertyContext.html#getProperty()\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator.JsonSchemaPropertyContext.getProperty()</code></a> is encountered during schema creation.",
      "translation": "在创建模式期间遇到特定<a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.JsonSchemaPropertyContext.html#getProperty()\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator.JsonSchemaPropertyContext.getProperty()</code></a>的上下文。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
