    {
      "source": "<a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a> extracts the <a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a> for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> by applying the\nfollowing mapping rules.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"MongoJsonSchemaCreator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>MongoJsonSchemaCreator</code></a> 通过应用以下映射规则，为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> 提取 <a href=\"schema/MongoJsonSchema.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>MongoJsonSchema</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul>\n<li>基本类型的特性</li>\n</ul><strong>Ignored Properties</strong><ul>\n<li>所有带有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Transient.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>Transient</code></a>注解的属性。</li>\n</ul><strong>Property Type Mapping</strong><ul>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'object'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Arrays.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Arrays</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'array'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'array'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'object'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Enum</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'string', enum : [the enum values]</code></li>\n<li>简单类型 -&gt; <code>type : '对应的 BSON 类型'</code></li>\n<li>域类型 -&gt; <code>type : 'object', properties : { 类型的属性 }</code></li>\n</ul><br/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>_id</code></a> properties using types that can be converted into\n<code>ObjectId</code> like <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> will be mapped to <code>type : 'object'</code> unless there is more\nspecific information available via the <a href=\"mapping/MongoId.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoId</code></a> annotation.\n<a href=\"mapping/Encrypted.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>Encrypted</code></a> properties will contain encrypt information.",
      "translation": "<ul>\n<li>基本类型的特性</li>\n</ul><strong>被忽略的属性</strong><ul>\n<li>所有带有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Transient.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>Transient</code></a>注解的属性。</li>\n</ul><strong>属性类型映射</strong><ul>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'object'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Arrays.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Arrays</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'array'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'array'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'object'</code></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Enum</code></a> -&gt; <code>type : 'string', enum : [枚举值]</code></li>\n<li>简单类型 -&gt; <code>type : '对应的 BSON 类型'</code></li>\n<li>嵌套类型 -&gt; <code>type : 'object', properties : { 类型的属性 }</code></li>\n</ul><br/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>_id</code></a> 属性若使用可转换为<code>ObjectId</code>的类型（如<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>），将映射为<code>type : 'object'</code>，除非通过<a href=\"mapping/MongoId.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoId</code></a>注解提供了更具体的信息。<a href=\"mapping/Encrypted.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>Encrypted</code></a>属性将包含加密相关信息。",
      "count": 1
    }
